1
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:12,981
Sign up as an FCSIT student
Students of the faculty get the archive, college tasks and announcements.

2
00:00:12,983 --> 00:00:15,502
Enter the faculty code
It is shared in your class group.

3
00:00:15,506 --> 00:00:21,949
Pick your level and program
This decides which courses, tasks and announcements you get.

4
00:00:24,163 --> 00:00:26,558
Your overview
Today’s tasks, your timetable and the latest posts from your class channel.

5
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:34,030
College announcements
Straight from the WhatsApp channels of your level, through HNU Board.

6
00:00:34,031 --> 00:00:41,304
Step 1: add your courses
They come from the college archive of your level, with every lecture.

7
00:00:41,306 --> 00:00:47,557
Every lecture is one click away
PDFs and sheets uploaded for the course.

8
00:00:47,558 --> 00:00:58,958
Click Add to my courses
Do it for every course you take this term.

9
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:05,790
Step 2: college tasks come by themselves
Every assignment for your level becomes a task, with its deadline and course.

10
00:01:05,791 --> 00:01:11,434
You get reminded before every deadline
1 day, 12 hours and 1 hour before. Missed ones show as closed.

11
00:01:11,437 --> 00:01:28,162
Plan your exams
Add the exam timetable and get a study plan for the days left.

12
00:01:28,163 --> 00:01:32,584
Step 3: bring your Obsidian notes
Upload your notes folder or a ZIP, then link each course to its folder.

13
00:01:32,585 --> 00:01:34,990
The course page
Its tasks, college lectures and your notes in one place.

14
00:01:34,992 --> 00:01:47,442
Share it with your class
One code gives classmates their own copy of the notes, exams and flashcards.

15
00:01:47,444 --> 00:01:57,981
Flashcards for every course
Spaced repetition before the exam, made from your notes.

16
00:01:57,982 --> 00:02:07,266
Competitive programming, built in
Codeforces and LeetCode stats, a daily problem and upcoming contests.

17
00:02:07,268 --> 00:02:13,965
Deadlines in your phone calendar
College tasks, lectures and exams in Google or iPhone Calendar.

18
00:02:13,967 --> 00:02:18,444
The faculty archive bot on Telegram
One tap from the top bar.
